    "text": "Lenexa\nPolice investigate a Kansas city council member’s citizenship after a complaint left via voicemail\nBy SHERMAN SMITH,\n7 hours agoLENEXA — Melanie Arroyo lives in two worlds. There’s the one where the Lenexa City Council member has to “assimilate and perform” like her white counterparts, she said. Then there’s the authentic world, where she is aware of how vulnerable she is in this country, “simply because I’m brown and because I have an accent.”",
